  "notes": "{訳|やく}す means to translate written text from one language to another.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ and ⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ particles\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- A⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧B⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{訳|やく}す: to translate A into B\n- ⟦{英語|えいご}→英語：02274_eigo⟧から⟦{日本語|にほんご}→日本語：00614_nihongo⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{訳|やく}す: to translate from English to Japanese\n- ⟦{直訳|ちょくやく}→直訳：13629_chokuyaku⟧する: to translate literally\n- ⟦{意訳|いやく}→意訳：17846_iyaku⟧する: to translate freely/liberally\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{翻訳|ほんやく}→翻訳：01725_honyaku⟧: translation (written)\n- ⟦{通訳|つうやく}→通訳：03516_tsuuyaku⟧: interpretation (oral)\n- {訳者|やくしゃ}: translator\n- {訳文|やくぶん}: translated text\n- ⟦{原文|げんぶん}→原文：20563_genbun⟧: original text\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n{訳|やく}す / ⟦{翻訳|ほんやく}→翻訳：01725_honyaku⟧ = written translation\n⟦{通訳|つうやく}→通訳：03516_tsuuyaku⟧ = oral interpretation (real-time)",
